  "topicId": "openjdk8-bytebuffer-selector",
  "title": "OpenJDK 8 ByteBuffer 与 Selector 源码解析",
  "primaryVersion": "OpenJDK 8u",
  "sourceRef": "jdk8u412-b08",
  "designInsight": "ByteBuffer 用 position、limit、capacity 三个游标表达读写窗口，Selector 再把多个通道的就绪事件汇聚成一次可消费的键集合。",
  "focusQuestion": "为什么 flip 不是把数据复制到新数组，而只是重新定义 position、limit 和读写方向？",
  "readingGoal": "能画出 write/flip/read/compact 的状态变化，并解释 Selector 注册、select 和 SelectionKey 就绪位。",
  "recommendedNextTopicId": "openjdk8-classloader-serviceloader",
  "recommendedNextReason": "从底层 I/O 状态切换到运行时类型发现，继续阅读 JDK 如何延迟解析和装配实现。",
  "versionComparison": {
    "id": "bytebuffer-selector",
    "summary": "Buffer 四指标、Selector 三个 key 集合和非阻塞协议跨 JDK 8/17/21 保持稳定，协变返回、区间切片、Consumer 选择、原子兴趣位和外部内存归属持续演进。",
    "supportedVersions": ["8", "17", "21"],
    "migrationHint": "先守住 flip、半包、selectedKeys 消费和 wakeup 不变量；再按最低 JDK 版本选择 slice(index,length)、Consumer select、interestOpsOr/And 与预览 Foreign Memory API。"
  },
